Subject: [PATCH 51/58] Freeze Mycelic-E2E v1: candidate C7, one pre-registered
 holdout world (M, seed 101)

Contract section 9 records the candidate code (C5 + K1 + K1b + observe query
fix + harness H1/H2, each reviewed by an agent that did not write it), the
evaluator, dev template, provider and holdout bank hashes, the dev evidence
(C7-S1 120/120 on dev S/1, optimistic by construction), the run settings and
the evaluation order. No holdout world has been generated.

